## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Supplier → Distributors (Cardinal Health, McKesson) → Hospitals/Pharmacies → Patients → Replenishment orders → FCF generation.  

This self-reinforcing loop drives consistent cash flow from its pharma distribution network.  

